Fubu-chan. Boin boin. Purin purin. I want to go together! No contact for 3 days. I want you to see. I want contact. I'm going to arrest you!

398
00:38:53,056 --> 00:38:57,056
すごい！ヤバイこのおじさん！普通にヤバイおじさんだ！
Amazing! This ojisan is dangerous! This is a normally dangerous ojisan!

399
00:38:58,056 --> 00:39:00,056
一緒にイキたいんじゃ！何してんのおじさん？
I want to go together! What are you doing, ojisan?

400
00:39:01,056 --> 00:39:04,556
でも2つ「いな」付いてるのもヤバイですね。いい踏んでる、いい踏んでる。
